{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5077426047825196389,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How Bootstrap does it",
      "source_hash": 7135939968957090927,
      "context_hash": 16675636755132635903,
      "translation": "부트스트랩이 이를 수행하는 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461034Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The core concept in Bootstrap is a build [`Step`],  which are chained together by [`Builder::ensure`]. [`Builder::ensure`] takes a [`Step`] as input, and runs the [`Step`] if and only if it has not already been run.",
      "source_hash": 11322554111598696453,
      "context_hash": 8804380186452341720,
      "translation": "부트스트랩의 핵심 개념은 빌드 [`Step`]으로, [`Builder::ensure`]에 의해 서로 연결됩니다. [`Builder::ensure`]는 [`Step`]을 입력으로 받아, 아직 실행되지 않은 경우에만 해당 [`Step`]을 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461034Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Let's take a closer look at [`Step`].",
      "source_hash": 73658522935773663,
      "context_hash": 2024810243364266628,
      "translation": "[`Step`]을 좀 더 자세히 살펴봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Synopsis of [`Step`]",
      "source_hash": 17145398525332735521,
      "context_hash": 14237054124310790888,
      "translation": "[`Step`]의 개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A [`Step`] represents a granular collection of actions involved in the process of producing some artifact.",
      "source_hash": 10840811623433208666,
      "context_hash": 12243088169783700840,
      "translation": "[`Step`]은 어떤 산출물을 만들어내는 과정에 관련된 세부적인 동작들의 집합을 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It can be thought of like a rule in Makefiles.",
      "source_hash": 5437809114709473434,
      "context_hash": 8302730728438899238,
      "translation": "이는 Makefile의 규칙과 비슷하다고 생각할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The [`Step`] trait is defined as:",
      "source_hash": 9808076613257775478,
      "context_hash": 8186151858290614667,
      "translation": "[`Step`] 트레이트는 다음과 같이 정의됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "trait": "트레이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`run` is the function that is responsible for doing the work. [`Builder::ensure`] invokes `run`.",
      "source_hash": 12702237912755142016,
      "context_hash": 6811327140231143856,
      "translation": "`run`은 실제 작업을 수행하는 함수입니다. [`Builder::ensure`]가 `run`을 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`should_run` is the command-line interface, which determines if an invocation such as `x build foo` should run a given [`Step`].",
      "source_hash": 5534459142836327864,
      "context_hash": 1990831146088681382,
      "translation": "`should_run`은 명령줄 인터페이스로, `x build foo`와 같은 호출이 주어진 [`Step`]을 실행해야 하는지 결정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "In a \"default\" context where no paths are provided, then `make_run` is called directly.",
      "source_hash": 15827173637263451233,
      "context_hash": 4887349828592295783,
      "translation": "경로가 제공되지 않는 \"기본\" 컨텍스트에서는 `make_run`이 직접 호출됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`make_run` is invoked only for things directly asked via the CLI and not for steps which are dependencies of other steps.",
      "source_hash": 6638576456061066043,
      "context_hash": 5029562709641141115,
      "translation": "`make_run`은 CLI를 통해 직접 요청된 항목에 대해서만 호출되며, 다른 스텝의 의존성인 스텝에 대해서는 호출되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The entry points",
      "source_hash": 16522366359781725480,
      "context_hash": 1676421378545993668,
      "translation": "진입점들",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There's a couple of preliminary steps before core Bootstrap code is reached:",
      "source_hash": 13041531975022446099,
      "context_hash": 2849774649247925837,
      "translation": "핵심 부트스트랩 코드에 도달하기 전에 몇 가지 예비 단계가 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461035Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Shell script or `make`: [`./x`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/x) or [`./x.ps1`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/x.ps1) or `make`",
      "source_hash": 6538660135689729900,
      "context_hash": 6464989181270361183,
      "translation": "셸 스크립트 또는 `make`: [`./x`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/x) 또는 [`./x.ps1`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/x.ps1) 또는 `make`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461036Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Convenience wrapper script: [`x.py`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/x.py)",
      "source_hash": 2317450427989204677,
      "context_hash": 1710854734541517238,
      "translation": "편의를 위한 래퍼 스크립트: [`x.py`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/x.py)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461036Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "[`src/bootstrap/bootstrap.py`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/src/bootstrap/bootstrap.py)",
      "source_hash": 496129940182078730,
      "context_hash": 8976530645283664630,
      "translation": "[`src/bootstrap/bootstrap.py`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/src/bootstrap/bootstrap.py)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461036Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "[`src/bootstrap/src/bin/main.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/src/bootstrap/src/bin/main.rs)",
      "source_hash": 11002463212851780646,
      "context_hash": 2153084457669509272,
      "translation": "[`src/bootstrap/src/bin/main.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/src/bootstrap/src/bin/main.rs)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461036Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "See [src/bootstrap/README.md](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/src/bootstrap/README.md) for a more specific description of the implementation details.",
      "source_hash": 13656731757791415066,
      "context_hash": 4160108475100295405,
      "translation": "구현 세부 사항에 대한 더 구체적인 설명은 [src/bootstrap/README.md](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/src/bootstrap/README.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T00:58:24.461036Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
